/****************************************************************************************
 * CAV model reporting tables
 * Source Excel files exported from R on 2026-09-26.
 *
 * Assumes the project setup has already defined:
 *   &dataroot.   root directory
 *   &goutpath.   RTF output directory (including trailing slash/backslash)
 *   &rdat8.      output date, e.g. 20260926
 *
 * Assumes styles.journal and styles.statistical are available, as in the existing
 * reporting programs.
 *
 * The two HR files are handled specially so that repeated constrained HRs and p-values
 * span the corresponding transition rows. The remaining tables use PROC REPORT.
 ****************************************************************************************/

